# Actions that ci/tools/bump-actions.sh must NOT move unattended.
#
# One entry per line: `owner/repo  reason`. Blank lines and `#` comments are
# ignored. A held pin is reported as a `note: held ...` line on every bump run,
# so it cannot be forgotten silently.
#
# Hold an action when something outside this repo pins its exact sha, so a
# bump PR would be rejected before any job runs instead of being reviewed.
# Remove the entry once that external pin moves.

# The repo and org Actions "allowed actions" policy lists this action by exact
# sha (msys2/setup-msys2@66cd2cce...). Any other sha makes windows-build.yml a
# startup_failure. Move the policy entry and this pin together, by hand.
msys2/setup-msys2  allowed-actions policy pins the exact sha
